MAYNARD, Mass. -- December 19, 1994 -- The Board of Directors of 
Digital Equipment Corporation (NYSE::DEC) has declared a regular 
cash dividend on its Series A 8 7/8% Cumulative Preferred Stock for 
the period from October 16, 1994 through January 15, 1995.  The 
dividend is equivalent to $.555 per depositary share.  Each 
depositary share represents ownership of one-fourth of a share of 
Series A 8 7/8% Cumulative Preferred Stock, par value $1.00 per 
share, issued March 21, 1994.

     Dividends are payable on January 15, 1995 to stockholders of 
record at the close of business on January 1, 1995.  The dividend 
